(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #114's cast must not swallow #91's miss handling: an
 absent key a `Set` could still insert - so the compiler cannot prove it
 missing - yields the destination's own empty value and sets the error
 flag, exactly as before this fix. Casting the miss's untyped 0 through
 the new text<-number cast would have printed "0" instead of the empty
 text #91 promises.)

